I like this idea too.  However, the format of the bones file that
was recently posted (from a PC version of nethack, I believe) appeared
significantly different from my UNIX bones files. My guess is that
one cannot port bones files from different operating systems.  Perhaps
a guru will confirm this.  I wondered what would happen if I mailed 
myself a bones file.  A lot of "null" characters were deleted.  My 
guess is that something similar would happen if I tried to post a 
bones file.  I tried ftp and that seemed to work OK, though the ftped 
file had 1 less byte than the original file.  Perhaps an anonymous 
ftp site would be useful for depositing/retrieving bones files.  

